{"seq":1,"slug":"kv-blocks","title":"KV 块与页：分页的最小单元","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/paged-attention-serving/paging/kv-blocks","wordCount":2065,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"kv-块与页-分页的最小单元\">KV 块与页：分页的最小单元</h1><p>分页的一切从一个决定开始：不再把序列的 KV 当作一整段连续显存，而是切成大小固定的小块。这个「块」（block）就是 PagedAttention 的原子单位，相当于操作系统里的一页。理解块的定义、块池的组织、以及块大小背后的权衡，是读懂后面块表与共享的前提。这一篇只讲块本身，不讲块表如何映射——那是下一篇的事。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-一个块装什么\">核心概念：一个块装什么</h2><p>一个 KV 块存放固定数量、连续 token 的 Key 和 Value 张量。vLLM 的默认块大小是 16 个 token（可用 <code>--block-size</code> 调整）。注意「块内连续、块间不连续」这个精妙之处：同一个块里的 16 个 token 在物理显存上是相邻的，这样注意力 kernel 处理一个块时能顺序访存、用满带宽；但块与块之间可以散落在显存任意位置，这样才拿掉了「整段连续」的约束。</p>\n<p>一个块占多少显存是可以精确算出来的。设层数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>、KV 头数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_{kv}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、每头维度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>、块大小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>、每个数值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 字节，一个块（含 K 和 V）的字节数为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>block</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{\\text{block}} = 2 \\cdot L \\cdot H_{kv} \\cdot d \\cdot B \\cdot b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">block</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>引擎启动时会把「扣掉权重和激活后剩下的显存」整个切成这样的块，形成一个<strong>块池</strong>（block pool）。此后所有请求都从这个池子里借块、用完还块，引擎再也不向底层显存分配器申请零散内存——分配这件事被收敛成「从池子里取一个空闲块」，简单到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[可用显存] --&gt; B[切分为固定大小块池]&#10;  B --&gt; C[空闲块队列]&#10;  C --&gt;|请求申请| D[分配块给序列]&#10;  D --&gt;|序列结束| E[归还块]&#10;  E --&gt; C&#10;  D --&gt; F[块内 16 token 连续&lt;br/&gt;块间任意位置]\">flowchart TD\n  A[可用显存] --&gt; B[切分为固定大小块池]\n  B --&gt; C[空闲块队列]\n  C --&gt;|请求申请| D[分配块给序列]\n  D --&gt;|序列结束| E[归还块]\n  E --&gt; C\n  D --&gt; F[块内 16 token 连续&lt;br/&gt;块间任意位置]</pre><h2 id=\"逻辑块与物理块-分家的两个身份\">逻辑块与物理块：分家的两个身份</h2><p>块有两个身份，务必分清。<strong>物理块</strong>是显存里真实的那 16 个 token 的存储位，属于块池，全局唯一，用块 ID 标识。<strong>逻辑块</strong>是某个序列视角里「我的第几段 KV」，从 0 开始连续编号。序列只认逻辑块，物理块由引擎统一调度。</p>\n<p>这层分家是全部灵活性的来源。因为序列只持有逻辑块号、不直接持有物理地址，引擎就能自由地：把一个逻辑块映射到任意物理块（消除外部碎片）；让两个序列的逻辑块指向同一个物理块（实现共享）；甚至把物理块换出到 CPU 再换回、换到另一个物理块（实现抢占换出）。序列全程无感。这两个身份如何通过一张表挂钩，是下一篇 <a href=\"block-tables\">块表与映射</a> 的核心；它们如何被多个序列共享，见 <a href=\"../sharing/copy-on-write\">写时复制</a>。</p>\n<p>下表对比两个身份的性质：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>逻辑块</th>\n<th>物理块</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>属于谁</td>\n<td>单个序列</td>\n<td>全局块池</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编号方式</td>\n<td>序列内从 0 连续</td>\n<td>全局块 ID</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否连续</td>\n<td>逻辑上连续</td>\n<td>物理上任意分布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能否共享</td>\n<td>否（每序列独有）</td>\n<td>能（多逻辑块可指向同一物理块）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>谁来管理</td>\n<td>序列的块表</td>\n<td>引擎的块池分配器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"内部碎片被压到一个块之内\">内部碎片被压到一个块之内</h2><p>回顾碎片篇讲过的内部碎片：连续分配用大粒度取整，浪费不小，见 <a href=\"../foundations/kv-fragmentation\">KV 内存碎片之痛</a>。分页把粒度缩到 16 token，于是内部碎片被牢牢限制在「最后一个块的未满部分」。一个序列无论多长，浪费最多就是最后那个块里没用满的几个 token 位，平均约半个块。</p>\n<p>量化一下。长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 的序列需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lceil S/B \\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span> 个块，内部碎片最多 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 个 token，浪费率上界为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>internal</mtext></msub><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>S</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{\\text{internal}} \\le \\frac{B-1}{S}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">internal</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 远大于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>（长序列），浪费率趋近于 0。这就是为什么分页能把内部碎片几乎抹平——而过度预留和外部碎片则靠「按需分配」和「不要求连续」分别解决。三种浪费一次治净，正是块这个设计的威力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"块大小-一个绕不开的取舍\">块大小：一个绕不开的取舍</h2><p>为什么是 16 而不是 1 或 256？块大小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 卡在两股相反的力之间。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 变小，内部碎片变小（上界 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>S</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{B-1}{S}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 下降），但块的数量变多，块表更长，注意力 kernel 每步要 gather 更多块、访存更零碎，管理与调度开销上升。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 变大则相反：kernel 访存更连续、块表更短，但内部碎片和共享粒度都变粗（前缀共享要整块匹配，块太大就难命中）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>块大小</th>\n<th>内部碎片</th>\n<th>块表长度</th>\n<th>kernel 访存</th>\n<th>前缀共享粒度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>偏小（如 4）</td>\n<td>极小</td>\n<td>长</td>\n<td>零碎、开销大</td>\n<td>细、易命中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>默认 16</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>适中</td>\n<td>均衡</td>\n<td>适中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>偏大（如 64）</td>\n<td>较大</td>\n<td>短</td>\n<td>连续、高效</td>\n<td>粗、难命中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>16 是社区在多数负载下测出的甜点，但它不是铁律：极长上下文、特殊硬件、或以前缀命中率为核心目标的场景，可能会调整它。前缀共享对块大小的敏感性，详见 <a href=\"../sharing/prefix-sharing\">前缀共享 (系统提示)</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"混合注意力模型的分页-每层的块不再一样\">混合注意力模型的分页：每层的块不再一样</h2><p>到目前为止都有一个隐藏前提：模型每一层的 KV 形状相同，于是全模型共用一个均匀的块池。2024–2025 年的<strong>混合注意力模型</strong>打破了这个前提。一类是全局注意力与滑动窗口注意力（SWA）交错——Gemma 2/3、Llama 4（iRoPE）等：SWA 层只需保留最近窗口 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 个 token 的 KV，有效序列长度被封顶：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>eff</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msubsup><mi>M</mi><mtext>kv</mtext><mtext>SWA 层</mtext></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{\\text{eff}} = \\min(S, W), \\qquad M_{\\text{kv}}^{\\text{SWA 层}} = 2 \\cdot H_{kv} \\cdot d \\cdot \\min(S, W) \\cdot b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1413em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">kv</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">SWA </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">层</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>另一类干脆混入线性注意力或 SSM 层——Jamba（arXiv:2403.19887）、MiniMax-M1（arXiv:2506.13585）、Qwen3-Next 的门控 DeltaNet 混排、Falcon-H1、IBM Granite 4.0 等：这些层不存逐 token 的 K/V，只维护一个每序列固定大小的循环状态，「页」在这个维度上根本不存在。</p>\n<p>对分页引擎的影响是结构性的：不同层的块尺寸与生命周期不再一致。主流引擎的解法是<strong>把层按 KV 形状分组</strong>——vLLM 在 2025 年初引入 hybrid KV cache manager（官方文档 Hybrid Models 一节），把全注意力层、SWA 层、SSM 层划入各自的 kv cache group，每组有自己的块池与几何；SWA 层按窗口上限预留，SSM 层的状态按槽位而非分页块分配。块表的含义随之升级：从「一张表」变成「每组一套映射」，序列的逻辑位置要在各组内分别解析，见 <a href=\"block-tables\">块表与映射</a>。混合模型由此成为分页抽象的一次压力测试：逻辑/物理解耦、按需分配这些原则不变，变的是参数化方式——从「每层统一」到「分组异构」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[混合模型的各层] --&gt; B[全注意力层组]&#10;  A --&gt; C[滑动窗口层组]&#10;  A --&gt; D[SSM / 线性注意力层组]&#10;  B --&gt; E[块池 1&lt;br/&gt;完整上下文分页]&#10;  C --&gt; F[块池 2&lt;br/&gt;按窗口 W 封顶]&#10;  D --&gt; G[固定状态槽位&lt;br/&gt;不分页]&#10;  E --&gt; H[同一序列&lt;br/&gt;每组一套块表映射]&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n  A[混合模型的各层] --&gt; B[全注意力层组]\n  A --&gt; C[滑动窗口层组]\n  A --&gt; D[SSM / 线性注意力层组]\n  B --&gt; E[块池 1&lt;br/&gt;完整上下文分页]\n  C --&gt; F[块池 2&lt;br/&gt;按窗口 W 封顶]\n  D --&gt; G[固定状态槽位&lt;br/&gt;不分页]\n  E --&gt; H[同一序列&lt;br/&gt;每组一套块表映射]\n  F --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; H</pre><p>选型提示：若负载以长上下文吞吐为主，混合模型在 KV 显存上天生占优——SWA 封顶与固定状态把 KV 从随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 线性增长降到常数或封顶值；代价是长程精确检索弱于全注意力，且并非所有推理特性（某些采样与前缀共享优化）对混合层都完备。部署前先确认引擎对该架构的支持成熟度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>块是分页的原子单位，默认存 16 个连续 token 的 K 和 V；块内连续、块间任意分布。</li>\n<li>引擎启动即把可用显存切成块池，之后分配退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的「从池取空闲块」。</li>\n<li>逻辑块（序列视角、从 0 连续）与物理块（全局块池、任意位置）分家，是灵活性的根源。</li>\n<li>细粒度块把内部碎片压到最后一个块之内，浪费率上界 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>S</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{B-1}{S}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，长序列趋近 0。</li>\n<li>块大小是内部碎片 vs 块表/kernel 开销 vs 共享粒度的三方取舍，16 是常见甜点而非铁律。</li>\n<li>混合注意力模型按 KV 形状把层分组：SWA 层按窗口封顶、SSM 层改用固定状态槽位，块表升级为每组一套映射（vLLM hybrid KV cache manager，2025 年初引入）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h3><ul>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"block-tables\">块表与映射</a> — 逻辑块与物理块如何挂钩</li>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"../foundations/kv-fragmentation\">KV 内存碎片之痛</a> — 块要解决的碎片问题</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../kv-cache-optimization/memory/paged-attention\">KV 缓存优化 · 分页注意力</a> — 块管理的平行讲解</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../llm-serving-inference-systems/systems/vllm-and-frameworks\">LLM 推理服务系统 · vLLM 与框架</a> — 块池在真实引擎里的位置</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"KV 块与页：分页的最小单元","id":"kv-块与页-分页的最小单元"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：一个块装什么","id":"核心概念-一个块装什么"},{"level":2,"text":"逻辑块与物理块：分家的两个身份","id":"逻辑块与物理块-分家的两个身份"},{"level":2,"text":"内部碎片被压到一个块之内","id":"内部碎片被压到一个块之内"},{"level":2,"text":"块大小：一个绕不开的取舍","id":"块大小-一个绕不开的取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"混合注意力模型的分页：每层的块不再一样","id":"混合注意力模型的分页-每层的块不再一样"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":3,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"虚拟内存类比：把操作系统的老智慧搬进推理引擎","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/paged-attention-serving/foundations/virtual-memory-analogy"},"next":{"title":"块表与映射：分页机制的中枢","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/paged-attention-serving/paging/block-tables"}}